#. fr: bloc de cire spéciale
#. column 2: lumps of forbidden wax
#. column 8: Forbidden in many markets for the nefarious means with which it is extracted, this wax is cherished by leatherworkers for the luster it brings to tanned hides when applied.
#. column 9: Forbidden Wax
msgctxt "Item:20005:0:0"
msgid "lump of forbidden wax"
msgstr "кусок запретного воска"

