#. de: Klumpen[p] Diatomit
#. fr: sac de terre diatomée
#. column 2: sacks of diatomite
#. column 8: Geological scholars claim that this sedimentary stone is actually comprised of the shells of thousands upon thousands of tiny sea creatures.
#. column 9: Diatomite
