#. ja: 粘板岩
#. de: Stück[p] Schiefer
#. fr: morceau d'ardoise
#. column 2: slabs of slate
#. column 8: Unlike other sedimentary stone, slate has been compressed under the weight of mountains for so long that it is surprisingly hard, making it ideal for whetstones and grinding stones.
#. column 9: Slate
msgctxt "Item:20007:0:0"
msgid "slab of slate"
msgstr "плита сланца"

#. de: Stücke[p] Schiefer
#. fr: morceaux d'ardoise
#. column 0: slab of slate
#. column 8: Unlike other sedimentary stone, slate has been compressed under the weight of mountains for so long that it is surprisingly hard, making it ideal for whetstones and grinding stones.
#. column 9: Slate
msgctxt "Item:20007:0:2"
msgid "slabs of slate"
msgstr "плиты сланца"

#. ja: 変成作用を受けた堆積岩の一種
#. de: Im Gegensatz zu anderem Sedimentgestein wurde Schiefer über lange Zeit unter dem Gewicht von Bergen gepresst, wodurch er erstaunlich hart geworden ist.
#. fr: Cette roche sédimentaire s'est formée via un processus de métamorphisme.
#. column 0: slab of slate
#. column 2: slabs of slate
#. column 9: Slate
msgctxt "Item:20007:0:8"
msgid "Unlike other sedimentary stone, slate has been compressed under the weight of mountains for so long that it is surprisingly hard, making it ideal for whetstones and grinding stones."
msgstr "В отличие от других осадочных пород, сланец веками сжимался под весом гор. В итоге он стал удивительно твёрдым, поэтому из него делают точильные камни и шлифовальные круги."

#. ja: 粘板岩
