#. column 0: slab of slate
#. column 2: slabs of slate
#. column 8: Unlike other sedimentary stone, slate has been compressed under the weight of mountains for so long that it is surprisingly hard, making it ideal for whetstones and grinding stones.
msgctxt "Item:20007:0:9"
msgid "Slate"
msgstr "Сланец"

