#. column 8: The elementally aspected remnants of aetherially reduced matter. This fine sand emits a weak glow indiscernible at gloaming.
#. column 9: Dusklight Aethersand
msgctxt "Item:20013:0:0"
msgid "handful of dusklight aethersand"
msgstr "горсть сумеречного эфира"

