#. de: Killifisch
#. fr: killi
#. column 2: killifish
#. column 8: This freshwater specimen of minuscule proportions can be found in almost any river and lake from central to eastern Othard.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Killifish
