msgctxt "Item:20038:0:9"
msgid "Zekki Grouper"
msgstr "Зеккийский групер"

#. ja: ソルトシールド
#. de: Salzschild-Schnapper
#. fr: trionyx serre-joint
#. column 2: saltshield snappers
#. column 8: This violent scalekin has the jaws of a carpenter's vise. Many a careless fisher has lost a fingertip or three when navigating the snapper-rich waters of Loch Seld.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Saltshield Snapper
msgctxt "Item:20039:0:0"
msgid "saltshield snapper"
msgstr "соляной щёлкун"

#. de: Salzschild-Schnapper
#. fr: trionyx serre-joints
#. column 0: saltshield snapper
#. column 8: This violent scalekin has the jaws of a carpenter's vise. Many a careless fisher has lost a fingertip or three when navigating the snapper-rich waters of Loch Seld.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Saltshield Snapper
msgctxt "Item:20039:0:2"
msgid "saltshield snappers"
msgstr "соляные щёлкуны"

#. ja: 塩湖に適応したスッポン<br>[魚拓額縁G3に設定可能]
#. de: Diese aggressive Schildkröte verfügt über einen gewaltigen Kiefer. So mancher Fischer hat dadurch bei Fischzügen auf dem Seldsee die ein oder andere Fingerkuppe verloren. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe L ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: La mâchoire de cette tortue est en forme d'étau de charpentier. Beaucoup de pêcheurs imprudents ont perdu un doigt ou deux à cause d'elle alors qu'ils naviguaient sur le lac Seld.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de grande taille]
#. column 0: saltshield snapper
#. column 2: saltshield snappers
#. column 9: Saltshield Snapper
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:20039:0:8"
msgid "This violent scalekin has the jaws of a carpenter's vise. Many a careless fisher has lost a fingertip or three when navigating the snapper-rich waters of Loch Seld.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]"
msgstr "У этой агрессивной чешуйчатой твари челюсти — как плотницкие тиски. Не один неосторожный рыбак лишился пальца, а то и нескольких, пробираясь по кишащим щёлкунами водам озера Селд.<br><br>[Можно поместить в большую рыбную раму.]"

