msgctxt "Item:20039:0:9"
msgid "Saltshield Snapper"
msgstr "Соляной щёлкун"

#. ja: スカルプター
#. de: Schnitzer
#. fr: sculpteur
#. column 2: sculptors
#. column 8: Remarkably similar in appearance to a shark, it is believed this salt lake fish periodically exposes its dorsal fin above the water's surface to frighten land predators such as bears.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Sculptor
msgctxt "Item:20040:0:0"
msgid "sculptor"
msgstr "скульптор"

#. de: Schnitzer
#. fr: sculpteurs
#. column 0: sculptor
#. column 8: Remarkably similar in appearance to a shark, it is believed this salt lake fish periodically exposes its dorsal fin above the water's surface to frighten land predators such as bears.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Sculptor
msgctxt "Item:20040:0:2"
msgid "sculptors"
msgstr "скульпторы"

#. ja: 塩湖に適応した鮫にも似た魚<br>[魚拓額縁G3に設定可能]
#. de: Dieser Salzseefisch sieht einem Hai zum Verwechseln ähnlich. Angeblich zeigt er häufiger mal seine Rückenflosse über der Was<shy>ser<shy>o<shy>ber<shy>flä<shy>che, um Raubtiere abzuschrecken. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe L ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: On raconte que ce poisson de lac salé, assez semblable à un requin, expose parfois sa nageoire dorsale au-dessus de la surface de l'eau pour effrayer des prédateurs tels que les ours.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de grande taille]
#. column 0: sculptor
#. column 2: sculptors
#. column 9: Sculptor
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:20040:0:8"
msgid "Remarkably similar in appearance to a shark, it is believed this salt lake fish periodically exposes its dorsal fin above the water's surface to frighten land predators such as bears.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]"
msgstr "Эта озёрная рыба удивительно похожа на акулу. Считается, что она время от времени выставляет спинной плавник над водой, чтобы отпугивать наземных хищников, например медведей.<br><br>[Можно поместить в большую рыбную раму.]"

