msgctxt "Item:20040:0:9"
msgid "Sculptor"
msgstr "Скульптор"

#. ja: パールアイ
#. de: Perlauge
#. fr: œil-de-perle
#. column 2: pearl-eyes
#. column 8: Prehistoric drawings of this salt lake fish have been discovered on cave walls throughout Gyr Abania, suggesting that this particular species has endured at least six umbral eras.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Pearl-eye
msgctxt "Item:20041:0:0"
msgid "pearl-eye"
msgstr "жемчужный глаз"

#. de: Perlaugen
#. fr: œils-de-perle
#. column 0: pearl-eye
#. column 8: Prehistoric drawings of this salt lake fish have been discovered on cave walls throughout Gyr Abania, suggesting that this particular species has endured at least six umbral eras.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Pearl-eye
msgctxt "Item:20041:0:2"
msgid "pearl-eyes"
msgstr "жемчужные глаза"

#. ja: 塩湖に適応した古代魚<br>[魚拓額縁G2に設定可能]
#. de: An einigen Höhlenwänden in Gyr Abania wurden prähistorische Zeichnungen dieses Salzseefisches gefunden, was vermuten lässt, dass diese Art bereits mehr als sechs Ären des Lichts überdauert hat. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe M ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Des dessins préhistoriques de ce poisson de lac salé ont été découverts dans de nombreuses grottes de Gyr Abania, ce qui suggère que cette espèce a survécu à au moins six fléaux.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de taille moyenne]
#. column 0: pearl-eye
#. column 2: pearl-eyes
#. column 9: Pearl-eye
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:20041:0:8"
msgid "Prehistoric drawings of this salt lake fish have been discovered on cave walls throughout Gyr Abania, suggesting that this particular species has endured at least six umbral eras.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]"
msgstr "Доисторические изображения этой озёрной рыбы находили на стенах пещер по всей Гир Абании. Похоже, этот вид пережил как минимум шесть Умбральных эр.<br><br>[Можно поместить в среднюю рыбную раму.]"

