#. de: othardisch[a] Lachs
#. fr: saumon seigneurial
#. column 2: lordly salmon
#. column 8: Just as do the salmon of Eorzea, the steely blue salmon of the Far East spend their lives in the sea before returning to the freshwater rivers where they were born to spawn and die.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Lordly Salmon
msgctxt "Item:20117:0:0"
msgid "lordly salmon"
msgstr "благородный лосось"

