#. ja: リトルペリュコス
#. de: klein[a] Perykos
#. fr: petit Perykos
#. column 2: little Perykos
#. column 8: As is the case with the little Thalaos, the little Perykos is anything but small. Though normally only found in the Indigo Deep, this lord of the North Isle of Endless Summer can sometimes be found swimming in the five seas and beyond...yet for what reason, no one knows.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Little Perykos
msgctxt "Item:20143:0:0"
msgid "little Perykos"
msgstr "малый Перикос"

