#. ja: 王魚
#. de: Königsfisch
#. fr: capucette royale
#. column 2: regal silversides
#. column 8: According to Hingan fishers, it was not until the past twenty summers that the regal silverside began appearing in their nets. It is popular opinion that the fish may have been introduced via bilge water dumped by foreign trade bulks.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Regal Silverside
msgctxt "Item:20147:0:0"
msgid "regal silverside"
msgstr "королевская атерина"

