msgctxt "Item:20157:0:9"
msgid "Zebra Shark"
msgstr "Зебровая акула"

#. ja: ホネガイ
#. de: Venuskammschnecke
#. fr: peigne de Nophica
#. column 2: Nophica's combs
#. column 8: The sharp, bone-like protrusions on this carnivorous mollusk's massive shell give it the comb-like appearance from which it earns its name.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Nophica's Comb
msgctxt "Item:20158:0:0"
msgid "Nophica's comb"
msgstr "гребешок Нофики"

