msgstr "Гребешок Нофики"

#. ja: 漁魚
#. de: warzig[a] Warzenfisch
#. fr: poisson-furoncle
#. column 2: warty wartfish
#. column 8: This sluggardly wartfish native to the One River somehow has more warts than a common wartfish, if that can be believed.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Warty Wartfish
msgctxt "Item:20159:0:0"
msgid "warty wartfish"
msgstr "бородавчатая рыба-бородавка"

