#. de: Beilfisch
#. fr: poisson-hachette
#. column 2: hatchetfish
#. column 8: The Ruby Sea hatchetfish earns its name from its overgrown head which, if you squint hard enough, might appear similar to the head of a timberlord's hatchet.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 1 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Hatchetfish
msgctxt "Item:20162:0:0"
msgid "hatchetfish"
msgstr "рыба-топорик"

