msgctxt "Item:20162:0:9"
msgid "Hatchetfish"
msgstr "Рыба-топорик"

#. ja: イトマキ
#. de: Fadenfisch
#. fr: poisson-fil
#. column 2: threadfish
#. column 8: This spindly saltwater fish spurns the colder currents of the north in favor of the warm waters along Othard and Ilsabard's southern coasts.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
