#. fr: anguille de jardin
#. column 2: garden eels
#. column 8: Garden eels spend most of their lives buried in sandy sea bottoms, emerging only to hunt and to mate.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Garden Eel
msgctxt "Item:20164:0:0"
msgid "garden eel"
msgstr "садовый угорь"

