msgstr "Веер тенгу"

#. ja: 輪宝貝
#. de: Sternen-Turbanschnecke
#. fr: turbo étoilé
#. column 2: star turbans
#. column 8: When viewed from the side, this sea mollusk's shell looks like a turban; however, when viewed from above, its radiating spines give it the appearance of a twinkling star.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Star Turban
msgctxt "Item:20189:0:0"
msgid "star turban"
msgstr "звёздный турбан"

