#. column 8: This freshwater fish commonly found in the upper One River is also known as the Mol gudgeon, the Kahkol gudgeon, the Dataqi gudgeon, the Horo gudgeon, and after whichever other Xaela tribe that insists their ancestors first caught the species.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
