#. ja: 具足海老
#. de: Languste
#. fr: langouste
#. column 2: spiny lobsters
#. column 8: This massive crustacean found in both the Ruby Sea and the Glass Ocean is considered a delicacy in the Far East, and is a luxury oft too extravagant for any but the richest of nobles to partake in.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
