#. ja: 逆龍
#. de: Drachen-Rückenschwimmer
#. fr: silure draconique
#. column 2: dragon squeakers
#. column 8: There are many theories as to why this remarkable breed of One River squeaker swims tail first, yet most have been dismissed as feeble attempts to explain what simply cannot be explained, such as why the sky is blue or why tides come in and the tides go out.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Dragon Squeaker
msgctxt "Item:20212:0:0"
msgid "dragon squeaker"
msgstr "рыба-дракон-перевёртыш"

#. de: Drachen-Rückenschwimmer
#. fr: silures draconiques
#. column 0: dragon squeaker
#. column 8: There are many theories as to why this remarkable breed of One River squeaker swims tail first, yet most have been dismissed as feeble attempts to explain what simply cannot be explained, such as why the sky is blue or why tides come in and the tides go out.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Dragon Squeaker
msgctxt "Item:20212:0:2"
msgid "dragon squeakers"
msgstr "рыбы-драконы-перевёртыши"

#. ja: 無二江に棲息する体を逆さにして泳ぐ淡水魚<br>[魚拓額縁G1に設定可能]
#. de: Es gibt viele Theorien, warum diese erstaunliche, im Einzig heimische Spezies rückwärts schwimmt, doch die meisten von ihnen haben sich schnell als unsinning herausgestellt. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe S ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Il existe de nombreuses théories cherchant à expliquer pourquoi cet habitant de la Muni nage à rebours, mais elles ont toutes été plus ou moins rejetées.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de petite taille]
#. column 0: dragon squeaker
#. column 2: dragon squeakers
#. column 9: Dragon Squeaker
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:20212:0:8"
msgid "There are many theories as to why this remarkable breed of One River squeaker swims tail first, yet most have been dismissed as feeble attempts to explain what simply cannot be explained, such as why the sky is blue or why tides come in and the tides go out.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]"
msgstr "Почему эта удивительная разновидность речного пискуна плавает хвостом вперёд? Теорий много, но все они — лишь жалкие попытки объяснить необъяснимое, вроде того, почему небо синее или почему приливы сменяются отливами.<br><br>[Можно поместить в малую раму для ихтиограммы.]"

