#. ja: イクシオンホルン
#. de: Ixion-Horn
#. fr: cor d'Ixion
#. column 2: Ixion clarions
#. column 8: It is said the legendary Ixion can be tamed by no man. With this horn, however, can the steed be calmed enough for one to mount his back.
#. column 9: Ixion Clarion
msgctxt "Item:20637:0:0"
msgid "Ixion clarion"
msgstr "сигнальный рог Иксиона"

#. de: Ixion-Hörner
#. fr: cors d'Ixion
#. column 0: Ixion clarion
#. column 8: It is said the legendary Ixion can be tamed by no man. With this horn, however, can the steed be calmed enough for one to mount his back.
#. column 9: Ixion Clarion
msgctxt "Item:20637:0:2"
msgid "Ixion clarions"
msgstr "сигнальные рога Иксиона"

#. ja: マウント修得<br>イクシオンを呼び出すための雷気漂う角笛
#. de: Angeblich kann das legendäre Ixion von niemandem gebändigt werden. Mit diesem Horn jedoch vermag man es genug zu besänftigen, um sich auf seinen Rücken zu schwingen.
#. fr: [Monture]<br>Ce cor qui dégage une aura électrique vous permet d'appeler Ixion.
#. column 0: Ixion clarion
#. column 2: Ixion clarions
#. column 9: Ixion Clarion
msgctxt "Item:20637:0:8"
msgid "It is said the legendary Ixion can be tamed by no man. With this horn, however, can the steed be calmed enough for one to mount his back."
msgstr "Говорят, легендарного Иксиона никому не удалось укротить. Но звуки этого рога усмиряют скакуна настолько, что на него можно взобраться."

