#. de: Steinfliegen-Larve
#. fr: zazamushi
#. column 2: stonefly larvae
#. column 8: Stonefly larvae─while extremely effective at catching certain varieties of fish─are difficult to find and near impossible to farm. As such, they command exorbitant prices at market. Live bait for freshwater fishing.
#. column 9: Stonefly Larva
msgctxt "Item:20675:0:0"
msgid "stonefly larva"
msgstr "личинка каменной мухи"

#. de: Steinfliegen-Larven
#. fr: zazamushi
#. column 0: stonefly larva
#. column 8: Stonefly larvae─while extremely effective at catching certain varieties of fish─are difficult to find and near impossible to farm. As such, they command exorbitant prices at market. Live bait for freshwater fishing.
#. column 9: Stonefly Larva
msgctxt "Item:20675:0:2"
msgid "stonefly larvae"
msgstr "личинки каменной мухи"

#. ja: 採集に手間が掛かり、高価で知られるトビケラの幼虫。淡水釣り用活餌
#. de: Steinfliegen sind zwar sehr effektiv zum Fischen, aber auch nur sehr schwer zu finden. Daher erzielen sie häufig hohe Preise am Markt. Ein Lebendköder für Süßwasserfische.
#. fr: Une larve de trichoptère rare et difficile à capturer, connue pour son prix élevé.<br>Appât vivant pour la pêche en eau douce.
#. column 0: stonefly larva
#. column 2: stonefly larvae
#. column 9: Stonefly Larva
msgctxt "Item:20675:0:8"
msgid "Stonefly larvae─while extremely effective at catching certain varieties of fish─are difficult to find and near impossible to farm. As such, they command exorbitant prices at market. Live bait for freshwater fishing."
msgstr "Личинок каменной мухи сложно найти и почти невозможно разводить, хотя на них отлично клюют некоторые рыбы. Поэтому на рынке за них просят бешеные деньги. Живая наживка для пресноводной рыбалки."

